ruitment 2026</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Advt No. : 03/ Exam/APO/EP-1/2026-27: Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 224px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%; text-align: center; height: 224px;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Application Begin : <strong>08/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Last Date for Apply : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>07/07/2026</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <b>07/07/2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>As Per Schedule</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Exam Date&nbsp; : <strong>As Per Schedule</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Result Declared : <b>As Per Schedule</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; text-align: center; height: 224px;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Application Fees (OTR)</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">General / BC/OBC Creamy Layer / Other State : <b>600/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">OBC / BC / EWS : <b>400/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">SC / ST : <b>400/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Correction Charge : <strong>500/-</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Cash at Rajasthan E Mitra Portal or Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, UPI Payment Mode.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 197px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 197px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer APO Notification 2026 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit as on 01/07/2027</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>21 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation as per Rajasthan Public Service Commission RPSC AAO Recruitment 2026 Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Associates Recruitment 2026 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 31.5577%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Eligibility Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 212px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 43px;\" colspan=\"2\">Rajasthan Assistant Prosecution Officer (APO) NON SA</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 43px;\" colspan=\"2\">355</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 68px;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Bachelor Degree in Law (LLB) from any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Working Knowledge of Hindi Devnagri and Knowledge of Rajasthani Dialects and Social Customs.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">Rajasthan Assistant Prosecution Officer (APO) SA</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\">15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill Rajasthan Assistant Prosecution Officer <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Online Form 2026</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rajasthan&nbsp; Public Service Commission (RPSC) has Released the Assistant Prosecution Officer 2026 Notification . Candidate Can Apply Between <b>08 June 2026 to 07 July 2026.<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in RPSC Apply Online for Assistant Prosecution Officer AAO 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and College the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the  updates on , admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 83px; width: 34.8366%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 31.5577%; height: 83px;\" colspan=\