-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">1. Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Online Form Start Date?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong>08 June 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>2. Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Exam Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Stage-I Examination will be conducted in <strong>As Per Schedule</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>3. Where can I find the syllabus for the Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>4. Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>5. Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Recruitment Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>07 July 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">07 July 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>7. How can I apply for Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>\n<figure id=\"attachment_23187\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-23187\" style=\"width: 1491px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23187\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201501%20996'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Prosecution Officer\" width=\"1501\" height=\"996\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/RPSC-APO-2026.jpg 1501w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/RPSC-APO-2026-300x199.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/RPSC-APO-2026-1024x679.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/RPSC-APO-2026-768x510.jpg 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1501px) 100vw, 1501px\" data-la